{"strongs": "H4639", "word": "מַעֲשֶׂה", "translit": "ma.a.seh", "root": "מעשה", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "deed, work", "definition": "מַעֲשֶׂה 233 noun masculine Gen 20:9 deed, work ; — absolute ׳ מ Gen 44:15 +, construct מַעֲשֵׂה Isa 5:12 +; suffix מַעֲשֵׂהוּ Judg 13:12 +, etc.; plural מַעֲשִׂים Gen 20:9 +; construct מַעֲשֵׂי Jer 1:16 +; suffix מַעֲשָׂיו 1Sam 19:4 (or singular, so Dr ) +, etc.; — often accusative of congnate meaning with verb with עשׂה ; — 1. a. (1) deed, thing done by man Num 16:28 ( J E ), 1Kgs 13:11 ; Isa 26:12 — 1Sam 20:19 is obscure; (2) implicit evil Gen 44:15 ( J ), Exod 23:24 ( E ), Neh 6:14 + 8 t., + singular collective doing(s) Mic 6:16 ; Lev 18:3 (twice in verse) ( H ), 2Chr 17:4 , יְדֵיהֶם ׳ מ Lam 3:64 ; Hag 2:14 ; Job 33:17 (reading מִמַּעֲשֵׂהוּ ᵐ5 Di Siegf Bu ), Ezek 16:30 ( behaviour ); explicit מַעֲשֵׂינוּ הָרָעִים Ezra 9:13 compare Eccl 4:3 ; Eccl 8:11 ; Eccl 8:14 , מַעֲשֵׂיאָֿוֶן Isa 59:6 specifically of idolatrous practices, יְדֵיכֶם ׳ מ singular Deut 31:29 ; Jer 25:6 ; Jer 25:7 ; Jer 32:30 , plural Jer 44:8 , compare singular 1Kgs 16:7 ; 2Kgs 22:17 = 2Chr 34:25 (3) implicit right, praiseworthy 1Sam 19:4 ; 2Kgs 23:19 ; Jonah 3:10 ; Prov 31:31 of duty in general אֲשֶׁר יַעֲשׂוּן ׳ הַמּ Exod 18:20 ( E ) = what they are to do ; explicit Eccl 4:4 ; Eccl 8:14 (4) as basis of judgment (good or bad) Isa 66:18 ; Ps 33:15 ; Ps 62:13 ; Eccl 12:14 , יְדֵיהֶם ׳ מ Jer 25:14 . \\ \\ b. (1) work, labour , husbandry Exod 23:16 ( E ), Gen 5:29 ( J ), Judg 19:16 , יְדֵיכֶם ׳ מ Hag 2:17 enforced labour of Israel in Egypt Exod 5:5 ; Exod 5:13 ( J ); in general Exod 23:12 ( E ); also of product of labour Exod 23:16 , compare Isa 65:22 ; Eccl 5:5 ׳ שֵׁשֶׁת יְמֵי הַמּ Ezek 46:1 the six working-days ; of religious work, ׳ עֲבֹדַת בֵּית הָא ׳ מ 1Chr 23:28 , compare ׳ מ 2Chr 31:21 (2) business, pursuit , Gen 46:33 ; Gen 47:3 ( J ), Judg 13:12 ; 1Sam 25:2 ; Isa 54:16 in general, occupation Isa 29:15 ; Eccl 2:4 ; Eccl 2:11 ; Eccl 3:17 ; Eccl 3:22 ; Eccl 8:9 ; Eccl 9:7 ; Eccl 9:10 (3) undertaking, enterprise Isa 19:14 ; Isa 19:15 ; Deut 15:10 יָדֶ֑ךָ ׳ מ Deut 2:7 + 5 t. Deuteronomy; 2Chr 32:30 ; Job 1:10 ; Ps 28:4 , יָדֵינוּ ׳ מ Ps 90:17 (twice in verse). (4) achievement Jer 48:7 ; Esth 10:2 (5) in weakened sense, מַעֲשֶׂיךָ Prov 16:3 thine affairs ; nearly = occurrences Eccl 1:14 (plural), Eccl 2:17 ; Eccl 8:17 (singular). \\ \\ c. deed(s), work(s) of ׳ י , especially in deliverance and in judgment, Judg 2:7 ; Judg 2:10 ; Josh 24:31 ( D ), Ps 33:4 + 21 t., + יָדָיו ׳ מ etc. Isa 5:12 ; Ps 28:5 ; Ps 92:5 + 4 t.; הָאֱלֹהִים ׳ מ in general Eccl 7:13 ; Eccl 8:17 ; Eccl 11:5 compare Eccl 3:11 . 2. a. (1) work, thing made , by man, אֹפֶה ׳ מ Gen 40:17 ( E ) baker's work ; יְדֵי יוֺצֵר ׳ מ Lam 4:2 often of furnishings of tabernacle, חשֵׁב ׳ מ Exod 26:1 + 7 t., רֹקֵם ׳ מ Exod 26:36 + 5 t., אֹרֵג ׳ מ Exod 28:32 + 2 t., חָרָשׁ ׳ מ Exod 28:11 , compare יְדֵי אָמָּן ׳ מ Song 7:2 of holy oil, etc, רֹקֵחַ ׳ מ Exod 30:25 + 2 t. (insert רֹקֵחַ perhaps also 2Chr 16:14 ); hence ׳ מ = work of art Isa 3:24 (of coiffure), compare ׳ כְּלִי מ Num 31:51 followed by noun of material, pattern, etc., עִזִּים ׳ מ v Num 31:20 (i.e. goats' hair), see also Exod 27:4 ; Exod 28:14 +; in temple, שְׂבָכָה ׳ מ 1Kgs 7:17 , ׳ מ שׁוּשַׁן v 1Kgs 7:19 , etc.; צַעֲצֻעִים ׳ מ 2Chr 3:10 , compare הַחֲבִתִּים ׳ מ 1Chr 9:31 the work of (consisting in) bread-wafers ; = materials of (prepared for) הָעוֺלָה 2Chr 4:6 in theoph. לִבְנַת הַסַּפִּיר ׳ מ Exod 24:10 ( J ); ׳ מ of ships 2Chr 20:37 in general Isa 29:16 ; Ezek 27:16 ; Ezek 27:18 = thy manufactures, wares ; מַעֲשַׂי Ps 45:2 = my verses ( ποίημα , poem ); (2) workmanship Ezek 1:16 (twice in verse) ( Ezek 1:16 a strike out Co Toy) 1Kgs 7:8 ; Exod 28:8 + 11 t.; (3) יְדֵי אָדָם ׳ מ of idols (contemptuously) Deut 4:28 ; 2Kgs 19:18 = Isa 37:19 = 2Chr 32:19 ; Ps 115:4 ; Ps 135:15 , compare Isa 2:8 ( יָדָיו ׳ מ ), Hos 14:4 ; Mic 5:12 ; Jer 1:16 so (יְדֵיׅ ׳ מ חָרָשׁ Deut 27:15 ; Jer 10:3 ; Jer 10:9 compare Hos 13:2 חֲכָמִים ׳ מ Jer 10:9 תַּעְתֻּעִים ׳ מ v Jer 10:15 ; Jer 51:18 apparently also מַעֲשֵׂהֶם Isa 41:29 compare Isa 57:12 ; Ezek 6:6 יָדָיו ׳ מ of altars Isa 17:8 . \\ \\ b. work (made by) God Exod 32:16 ( E ); especially (poetry and late), of created things, Ps 103:22 ; Ps 104:24 + 4 t. Psalms; אֶצְבְּעֹתֶיךָ ׳ מ Ps 8:4 , יָרֶיךָ ׳ מ Ps 102:26 (both of heavens), compare Ps 19:2 (heavenly bodies), Ps 8:7 (animals); of man Job 14:15 ; Job 34:19 , compare לָדַעַת כָּלאַֿנְשֵׁי מַעֲשֵׂהוּ Job 37:7 (but read probably אנשׁים ᵑ9 Ol Di and others); of nation Isa 19:25 ; Isa 60:21 ; Isa 64:7 of weights Prov 16:11 (but read perhaps הַמֶּלֶךְ ) for ׳ י Gr Toy). \\ \\ c. product of olive-tree, זַיִת ׳ מ Hab 3:17 figurative product of righteousness Isa 32:17 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6434')\">BDB6434</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4639')\">H4639</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6433')\">BDB6433</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6435')\">BDB6435</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מַעֲשֶׂה</bdbheb><sub>233</sub> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Gen 20:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,20,9)\">Gen 20:9</ref></sup> <highlightword>deed, work</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 44:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,44,15)\">Gen 44:15</ref> +, construct <bdbheb>מַעֲשֵׂה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 5:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,12)\">Isa 5:12</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>מַעֲשֵׂהוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 13:12\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,12)\">Judg 13:12</ref> +, etc.; plural <bdbheb>מַעֲשִׂים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 20:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,20,9)\">Gen 20:9</ref> +; construct <bdbheb>מַעֲשֵׂי</bdbheb>