ef> (4) as basis of judgment (good or bad) <ref ref=\"Isa 66:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,18)\">Isa 66:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 33:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,33,15)\">Ps 33:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 62:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"62\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"62\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,62,13)\">Ps 62:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:14\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,14)\">Eccl 12:14</ref>, <bdbheb>יְדֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 25:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,25,14)\">Jer 25:14</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> (1) <highlight>work, labour</highlight>, husbandry <ref ref=\"Exod 23:16\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,16)\">Exod 23:16</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Gen 5:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,5,29)\">Gen 5:29</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Judg 19:16\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(7,19,16)\">Judg 19:16</ref>, <bdbheb>יְדֵיכֶם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hag 2:17\" b=\"37\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(37,2,17)\">Hag 2:17</ref> enforced labour of Israel in Egypt <ref ref=\"Exod 5:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,5,5)\">Exod 5:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 5:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,5,13)\">Exod 5:13</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); in general <ref ref=\"Exod 23:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,12)\">Exod 23:12</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"