19,90,17)\">Ps 90:17</ref> (twice in verse). (4) <highlight>achievement</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 48:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,7)\">Jer 48:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 10:2\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(17,10,2)\">Esth 10:2</ref> (5) in weakened sense, <bdbheb>מַעֲשֶׂיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 16:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,3)\">Prov 16:3</ref> <highlight>thine affairs</highlight>; nearly = <highlight>occurrences</highlight> <ref ref=\"Eccl 1:14\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(21,1,14)\">Eccl 1:14</ref> (plural), <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:17\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,17)\">Eccl 2:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 8:17\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(21,8,17)\">Eccl 8:17</ref> (singular). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <highlight>deed(s), work(s)</highlight> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, especially in deliverance and in judgment, <ref ref=\"Judg 2:7\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(7,2,7)\">Judg 2:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 2:10\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(7,2,10)\">Judg 2:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 24:31\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(6,24,31)\">Josh 24:31</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Ps 33:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,33,4)\">Ps 33:4</ref> + 21 t., + <bdbheb>יָדָיו</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> etc. <ref ref=\"Isa 5:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,12)\">Isa 5:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 28:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,28,5)\">Ps 28:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 92:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"92\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"92\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,92,5)\">Ps 92:5</ref> + 4 t.; <bdbheb>הָאֱלֹהִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> in general <ref ref=\"Eccl 7:13\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(21,7,13)\">Eccl 7:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 8:17\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(21,8,17)\">Eccl 8:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 11:5\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(21,11,5)\">Eccl 11:5</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Eccl 3:11\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(21,3,11)\">Eccl 3:11</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2. a.</b> (1) <highlight>work, thing made</highlight>, by man, <bdbheb>אֹפֶה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 40:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,40,17)\">Gen 40:17</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) <highlight>baker's work</highlight>; <bdbheb>יְדֵי יוֺצֵר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 4:2\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(25,4,2)\">Lam 4:2</ref> often of furnishings of tabernacle, <bdbheb>חשֵׁב</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 26:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,26,1)\">Exod 26:1</ref> + 7 t., <bdbheb>רֹקֵם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 26:36\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(2,26,36)\">Exod 26:36</ref> + 5 t.,<bdbheb>אֹרֵג</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 28:32\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,32)\">Exod 28:32</ref> + 2 t., <bdbheb>חָרָשׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 28:11\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,11)\">Exod 28:11</ref>, compare <bdbheb>יְדֵי אָמָּן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 7:2\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(22,7,2)\">Song 7:2</ref> of holy oil, etc, <bdbheb>רֹקֵחַ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 30:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,25)\">Exod 30:25</ref> + 2 t. (insert <bdbheb>רֹקֵחַ</bdbheb> perhaps also <ref ref=\"2Chr 16:14\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(14,16,14)\">2Chr 16:14</ref>); hence <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> = <highlight>work of art</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 3:24\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(23,3,24)\">Isa 3:24</ref> (of coiffure), compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כְּלִי מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 31:51\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"51\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"51\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,51)\">Num 31:51</ref> followed by noun of material, pattern, etc., <bdbheb>עִזִּים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Num 31:20\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,20)\">Num 31:20</ref> (i.e. goats' hair), see also <ref ref=\"Exod 27:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,4)\">Exod 27:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 28:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,14)\">Exod 28:14</ref> +; in temple, <bdbheb>שְׂבָכָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:17\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,17)\">1Kgs 7:17</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>שׁוּשַׁן</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:19\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,19)\">1Kgs 7:19</ref>, etc.; <bdbheb>צַעֲצֻעִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</b